WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:07.974 size:53% position:73% line:53%
inondations. On se prépare,

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:08.842 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme nous le dit Melissa

00:00:05.806 --> 00:00:09.709 size:53% position:73% line:53%
François.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.577 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Engagés dans une véritable

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:11.478 size:53% position:73% line:53%
course contre la montre,

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.345 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces résidents préparent le plus

00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:13.213 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de sacs de sable que possible

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.081 size:53% position:73% line:53%
afin de protéger leur propriété.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:16.483 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- It's time to go.

00:00:13.547 --> 00:00:16.483 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les quincailleries

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.483 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont été prises d'assaut.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.687 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais tout le monde n'a pas

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.688 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le même empressement.

00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:22.923 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ce couple s'est préparé au pire;

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.124 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il attend Ian sur la plage.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:25.358 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- We're not too concerned

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.893 size:53% position:73% line:53%
at all.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:28.428 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sa trajectoire préoccupe

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.963 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les autorités.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:31.498 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ian continue sa route vers

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:32.999 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la côte ouest de la Floride

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:34.534 size:53% position:73% line:53%
après avoir frappé Cuba.

00:00:31.832 --> 00:00:36.536 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Son passage dans les eaux

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:38.572 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chaudes du golfe du Mexique

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:40.607 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pourrait faire de lui

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:42.642 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un ouragan majeur de catégorie 4

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:44.644 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur une échelle de 5.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:46.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Quelque 2,5 millions de

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:48.682 size:53% position:73% line:53%
personnes ont reçu l'ordre

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:50.717 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'évacuer. C'est le cas

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:52.719 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Marie-Claude Tremblay.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:54.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MARIE-CLAUDE TREMBLAY,

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:56.289 size:53% position:73% line:53%
résidente de Tampa

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:57.791 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les choses qui nous sont

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:59.826 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chères, que j'ai mises en

00:00:56.623 --> 00:01:01.828 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hauteur. Je prends ce que j'aime

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:04.931 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le plus parce que je sais pas

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:09.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
si je vais revoir le restant

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:13.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de mes vêtements,

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:16.076 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de mes affaires, t'sais.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:19.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le gouverneur de Santis

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:19.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a réitéré ce message à ceux qui

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
défient l'ordre d'évacuation.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.757 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Des abris sont mis en place,

00:01:28.622 --> 00:01:31.992 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelque 5000 soldats de

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:33.193 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la garde nationale de l'État

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.427 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Floride sont déployés.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.662 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le mot d'ordre est la sécurité,

00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:36.863 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car les biens matériels se

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:40.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
remplacent, mais pas les vies.

00:01:35.996 --> 00:01:40.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Mélissa François,

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:40.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Montréal.

